{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Over living water</b> as we find with Naaman, who was healed of his tzara'at by living water, and therefore a zav requires immersion in living water, unlike other impure persons who do not require it. For healing through living water:" "<b>על מים חיים</b> in gematria: not in salt water."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:22.311528238Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}